          .query
            %p
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"}> Urs
              \: Here it says “a local system”. I suppose “simplicial local system” is meant? We should have a discussion about how this notion of simplicial local system relates to the functors from fundamental groupoids discussed at
